' plantuml-version: 1.2026.8
@startuml 03-logical-code-booking
title Código (C4 nível 4) · o agregado Booking (Dom/Bookings/Booking.cs)

hide empty members
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #1168BD
  ArrowColor #555555
}
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #85BBF0

class Booking <<D-BOOKING>> <<sealed>> {
  - Booking()
  + Id : Guid
  + PitchId : Guid
  + PlayerId : Guid?
  + CustomerName : string?
  + CustomerPhone : string?
  + IsForCustomer : bool
  + StartsAt : DateTime
  + EndsAt : DateTime
  + Price : decimal
  + Status : BookingStatus
  + CreatedAt : DateTime
  + CancelledAt : DateTime?
  + CancellationReason : string?
  + IsConfirmed : bool
  + SeriesId : Guid?
  ..
  + {static} ForPlayer(pitchId, playerId, startsAt, endsAt, price, now, seriesId = null) : Booking
  + {static} ForCustomer(pitchId, customerName, customerPhone, startsAt, endsAt, price, now) : Booking
  ..
  + CancellationDeadline(window) : DateTime
  + {static} CancellationDeadline(startsAt, window) : DateTime
  + CanBeCancelledByPlayer(window, now) : bool
  + {static} CanBeCancelledByPlayer(status, startsAt, window, now) : bool
  + CancelByPlayer(window, now) : CancellationOutcome
  + CancelByClub(reason, now) : ClubCancellationOutcome
  + MarkNoShow(now) : bool
  + RecordNoShow(now) : NoShowOutcome
  + UndoNoShow() : bool
  + HasStarted(now) : bool
  + Overlaps(startsAt, endsAt) : bool
  ..
  - {static} EnsureWindow(window) : TimeSpan
  - {static} EnsureUtc(value) : DateTime
}

enum BookingStatus <<D-BOOKING>> {
  Confirmed
  CancelledByPlayer
  CancelledByClub
  NoShow
}

enum CancellationOutcome <<D-BOOKING>> {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  OutsideWindow
}

enum ClubCancellationOutcome <<D-BOOKING>> {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  AlreadyStarted
}

enum NoShowOutcome <<D-BOOKING>> {
  Marked
  NotConfirmed
  NotEnded
}

class BookingStatuses <<D-BOOKING>> <<static>> {
  + {static} ToCode(status) : string
}

class BookingRules <<D-BOOKING>> <<static>> {
  + {static} CancellationReasonMaximumLength = 200
}

Booking --> BookingStatus : Status
Booking ..> CancellationOutcome : CancelByPlayer
Booking ..> ClubCancellationOutcome : CancelByClub
Booking ..> NoShowOutcome : RecordNoShow
BookingStatuses ..> BookingStatus : confirmed, cancelled_by_player,\ncancelled_by_club, no_show

note right of Booking
  **Invariantes nos métodos**
  Todas as propriedades têm private set; o construtor é privado.
  ForPlayer: playerId ≠ Guid.Empty; ForCustomer: nome e telemóvel
  preenchidos (aparados); ambos: EndsAt > StartsAt, Price > 0,
  Status = Confirmed, Id = Guid.CreateVersion7(), instantes UTC.
  Um método que devolve um resultado só muda o estado quando
  o resultado é o de sucesso (Cancelled, Marked, true).
  CancelByClub sem motivo é erro de programação (exceção):
  o serviço valida antes. A janela de cancelamento entra como
  argumento e nunca é guardada na reserva.
  Overlaps é meio aberto [início, fim), como bookings_no_overlap.
end note

@enduml
